# DomiWEB · menus only (always)

The product is the **digital menu + QR + WhatsApp ordering** funnel for food businesses. Do not run talleres / auto-repair scrapes or default to full marketing websites.

## Default funnel

1. Scrape/qualify with restaurant niche (`config/niche.config.json`)
2. `generate-menus`
3. `claim-pages` (defaults to menu)
4. `outreach` (WhatsApp link = **claim URL only**)
5. `send-whatsapp` (then `--price` / `--close` as needed)
6. Commit + push `public/menus`, `public/claim`, `public/edit-menu` before first WA

## URLs

- **1:1 outreach / owner link:** always `…/claim/<slug>/` (standard). Never lead with `/menus/<slug>/`.
- **Public / promo share:** `https://tinyurl.com/domenus` (pretty short link → menu-digital splash). Env: `MENU_SHARE_URL`.

## Do not

- Scrape or pitch talleres mecánicos
- Default to `generate-sites` / claim `site`
- Treat “claim site” / “create a site” / “scan and claim” as a website request — ship the **menu** claim instead
- Put the long GitHub Pages menu or splash URL in first-touch WhatsApp or ads — claim for owners, tinyurl.com/domenus for product share
- Invent real dish prices; placeholder items + honesty footer only

## Exception

Use `generate-sites` or `--product site` / `reviewKit` only when the user explicitly asks.
